 people have taken up residence here.'\nYou say, 'stay out'\nEverna Delestrod says, 'This area is meant to be for us 'mortals' to use, but apparently we haven't been here using it for so long that some of the [fire creatures] have grown curious and wandered in to look around. A few of them even seem to live here now. I suppose we could try to go through official channels to get rid of them, but for now I just stand here and remind them that they shouldn't be here. That at least keeps them out of this little area.'\nYou say, 'fire creatures'\nEverna Delestrod says, 'They are all here, all four elemental types. It seems that this is where you go if you want to talk with someone of authority among the efreeti. Everyone here that isn't a guard or official of some type seems to be trying to get into the palace and make some sort of request. Each of them has some overly complex desire and has gone through so many hoops to get here that you or I would be made ill just trying to understand it all. Of course my [needs] are far less complicated.'\nYou say, 'needs'\nEverna Delestrod says, 'Ah, well, simple but perhaps not exactly polite. My employer needs, to put it delicately, elemental bits and pieces. You know, the sort that comes off of creatures. Now, what I have noticed is that the local fire folk don't really like their visitors much. They have guards here and there, posted in towers and such, who are clearly not there to protect the visitors. Nope they are only here to make sure they do not get out of hand. If they fight with each other, guards don't care much. So, you see, an adventurer could readily [take advantage] of this and do as they please, so long as they did not harm the locals.'\nYou say, 'take advantage'\nEverna Delestrod says, 'Should you be so inclined, I would be grateful if you could gather some things for me.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Gathering Elements: Air'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Deliver 10 Essence of Elemental Air to Everna Delestrod 0/10 Aalishai: Palace of Embers\n**Task Window:** Everna has asked you to gather air essence from the corpses of creatures from the plane of air that you might find in Aalishai.\nEssence of Elemental Air drops off mobs in the northern part of the zone, including :\na brume armor\na flurry mephit\na gale\na gusty mephit\na tempest gust\na travelling djinn\nNote that this is a \"Deliver\" step, which means those essences can be prelooted.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 pp, 5 gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 212 pp, 5 gold",
